# 🧠 AI Memory Vault 2.0

AI Memory Vault 2.0 is a personal digital memory management system designed to store, organize and preserve important memories in one place.

## ✨ Features

- 🔐 User Login & Registration
- 📸 Photo Memory Management
- 📝 Notes Management
- 📄 Document Management
- 🎙️ Voice Notes
- 🔎 Memory Search
- 📊 Memory Analytics Dashboard
- 👤 User Profile
- 📱 Progressive Web App (PWA)
- 💾 Local memory storage
- 🖥️ Desktop application support

## 🛠️ Technologies Used

### Frontend
- React.js
- Vite
- JavaScript
- CSS
- React Router DOM
- Context API

### Backend
- Node.js
- Express.js
- MongoDB

### Additional Technologies
- Progressive Web App (PWA)
- Electron

